.TH FACTOR "1" "April 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
factor \- factor numbers

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B factor
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR] [\fI\,NUMBER\/\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Print the prime factors of each specified integer NUMBER. If no NUMBER(s) are specified, read them
from standard input.

.SH OPTIONS
None.

